## Context

Once the vocabulary renames are applied in code, data, config,
prompts, and report, the remaining references in tickets and memory
files should be updated so future agents do not re-import the old
names.

## Actions

1. Grep all `tickets/*.erg` and `tickets/archive/*.erg` bodies for
   deprecated names (old method values, old sweep IDs, old filenames).
   Append a `note` log entry to each affected ticket describing the
   rename (do not edit history).
2. Grep `~/.claude/projects/.../memory/*.md` for deprecated names;
   update affected memory files to use the new vocabulary.
3. Update `MEMORY.md` index if any memory file titles change.
4. Update `STATE.md` if it references deprecated names.
5. Close epic 0069 with a log entry summarising the full audit.

## Exit criteria

- No live ticket body contains deprecated method/sweep names.
- No memory file contains deprecated names.
- Epic 0069 closed.
